(3, 'UNDER ARMOUR Men Woven Design HOVR Infinite 4 Running Shoes', 'Product design details:A pair of grey woven design shoes, has regular Styling, lace-ups detailBrand colour: Tempered Steel / Aurora Purple-500Best for: Long & everyday runs with a secure fitEngineered mesh upper is extremely lightweight & breathable, with strategic support where you need it3D-molded sockliner cradles your foot for enhanced step-in comfortResponsive UA HOVR cushioning reduces impact, returns energy & helps propel you forwardAnatomically placed, deep flex grooves offer proper flexibility in key areasCarbon rubber pods under the heel deliver greater traction & durability at high-impact strike zonesWarranty: 3 monthsWarranty provided by the brand/manufacturerAbout UNDER ARMOUR HOVR Infinite 4 Running ShoesWe kept the reliable, smooth, secure feel of the Infinite you love...but we simplified the upper, flipped the UA HOVR cushioning, and rethought the sole, giving you a lighter, softer, more durable every day running shoe. Material & Care: Upper Material: 98% Textile,2% Synthetic. Sole Material: 100% Rubber. Wipe with a clean, dry cloth to remove dust.', 13499.00, 49, 'https://assets.myntassets.com/assets/images/22054912/2023/7/11/17ab8c64-02eb-4dc6-958a-89724dd7060b1689048177186UNDERARMOURMenWovenDesignHOVRInfinite4RunningShoes1.jpg', NOW(6), NOW(6)),
