(3, 'ELEVAR Men ARC RACER All Purpose Sports Shoes', 'A versatile all purpose sports shoe that can be used for running, fitness, or for casual wearRYDEFOAM midsole technology - an eTPU sole for best in class cushioning & energy returnAEROKNIT upper - a lightweight 3D Knit upper that is breathable & flexibleDiamond texture rubber outsole provides durability and tractionExternal heel counter & double loop lace system for extra stabilityWarranty: 3 monthsProduct StoryThe ARC RACER is made using the world''s most innovative, comfortable and responsive sole material - eTPU (expanded thermoplastic polyurethane).Our proprietary RYDEFOAM technology is designed such that the shoe feels soft like a pillow on your feet while walking, yet springs into action the moment you need it to deliver on performance activities.Our world-class sole tech and 3D flexible knit is merged together by craftsmen with over 30 years of experience.The result is a shoe that can withstand the toughest of workouts while providing you all-day comfort and aesthetic versatility to wear to the office or for a night out.About ELEVARElevar is one of the fastest growing sports brands in India. The brand''s mission is to create innovative, stylish and affordable products by intertwining cutting-edge design and performance driven engineering.Elevar''s value proposition is to provide world class materials that international brands incorporate in their top-of-the-line flagship products, at one-third the price. It''s able to do this by disrupting traditional market norms - by going direct-to-consumer, Elevar is able to cut out all middlemen and pass on savings to the customer. The end result is saving markup costs & investing it into making world class products that are affordable.Specifications Master List:SportFasteningOutsole typeInsolePronationRunning typeDistanceMaterialAnkle HeightCleatsCushioningWarrantySurface typeWeight Shoe WidthStack HeightSpecifications ARC RACER:Sport: Running & FitnessFastening: Slip on with lacesOutsole type: RubberInsole: FoamPronation:', 6490.00, 184, 'https://assets.myntassets.com/assets/images/19324484/2022/8/29/4116916a-1826-46c1-bd73-452eda3388571661770723910-ELEVAR-Men-White-ARC-RACER-All-Purpose-Sports-Shoes-56216617-2.jpg', NOW(6), NOW(6)),
