(3, 'ELEVAR Men Black FLYBOLT Running Sports Shoes', 'SPECIAL TECHNOLOGIES:RYDEFOAMTM midsole technology - an eTPU sole for best in class cushioning & energy return.AEROKNITTM upper - a lightweight 3D Knit upper that is breathable & flexible.PRODUCT DESIGN DETAILS:A pair of black shoes, has regular Styling, lace-ups detailTextile upperCushioned footbedTextured and patterned outsoleWarranty: 3 monthsABOUT FLYBOLT Men Running Shoes:The Ultimate Running Shoes - FLYBOLT is constructed with advanced sneaker tech and cushioning that makes you fly!Our RYDEFOAM(r) sole is made with eTPU, the world''s most comfortable and responsive material. To give you unmatched comfort with superior energy return.The AEROKNIT(r) upper and the micro-fiber tongue is designed to give you a comfortable sock-like fit and the best mid-foot support.Molded TPU reinforcements at the heel and toe keep your feet secure and provide maximum stability during landings and take-offs.Engineered to perfection for an unforgettable running experience. Material & Care: Textile upper. Sole: E-TPU (Expanded Thermoplastic Polyurethane). Wipe with a clean cloth to remove dust.', 5490.00, 26, 'https://assets.myntassets.com/assets/images/19334944/2022/8/29/e101cee7-a2a6-4ddc-998f-f9b8eb19aca41661773105918-ELEVAR-Men-Black-FLYBOLT-Running-Sports-Shoes-78216617731055-1.jpg', NOW(6), NOW(6)),
