(3, 'PUMA Hoops Men Red Triple Mid Basketball Shoes', 'Special Technologies:ProFoam: PUMA''s lightweight, high-rebound EVA midsole solution provides instant cushioning and a responsive rideCMEVA: PUMA''s compression-moulded EVA material for lightweight performanceFeatures:A pair of red basketball shoes, has mid-top Styling, lace-ups detailMid bootMesh upper with leather overlaysProFoam EVA midsoleRubber outsoleLockdown lacing system for a snug fitPUMA Formstrip in triplicate across midsole and upper lateral sidesWarranty: 3 monthsWarranty provided by brand/manufacturerAbout The PUMA Hoops Unisex Red Triple Mid Basketball Shoes:In the game or on the street, this shoe performs at the highest level. Lightweight ProFoam runs the full length of the midsole for responsive rebound power when you need it, and the full coverage rubber outsole generates super sticky traction across the court. Performance mesh and leather overlays look fresh and feature PUMA''s Formstrip in triptych between the midsole and upper. Formstrip lacing system delivers foot lockdown for extra stability at speed, cementing this shoe''s position as a real powerhouse piece. Material & Care: Mesh. Wipe with a clean dry cloth to remove dust.', 4049.00, 39, 'https://assets.myntassets.com/assets/images/16880520/2022/8/10/466e79a5-b96f-4f8d-acaa-990ed6c92bcb1660116880455-PUMA-Hoops-Men-Red-Triple-Mid-Basketball-Shoes-3591660116879-1.jpg', NOW(6), NOW(6)),
