(3, 'Puma Women Purple Electrify Nitro Turn Running Shoes', 'Design Details:A pair of purple running shoes, has regular Styling, lace-ups detailTextile upperCushioned footbedTextured and patterned outsoleLow bootAll-new running last developed based on biomechanical research and testingUpper executed in ultra lightweight mono meshMidsole with NITRO FOAM technology for superior responsiveness and cushioningMidsole with ProFoam Lite for durable cushioningDurable PUMAGRIP rubber compound for all-surface tractionForefoot rubber provides optimal bending stiffness and maximum tractionMinimal heel rubber gives ideal durabilityHeel TPU piece provides visibility from reflectivity and stability through proprioceptionBold PUMA Cat Logo on lateral side and tongue as well as reflective brandingThis shoe is ideal for road & indoor running.Warranty: 3 monthsWarranty to be provided by the brand/manufacturerAbout Electrify Nitro Turn Women''s Shoes: Electrify Nitro Turn Women''s Shoes with its futuristic design, bright colours, and bold PUMA branding is a one to get your hands on. The NITRO FOAM technology and PUMAGRIP provides optimum cushioning and outstanding traction on any surface. Material & Care: Textile. Wipe with a clean dry cloth to remove dust.', 4999.00, 174, 'https://assets.myntassets.com/assets/images/16824638/2022/5/23/0e476b28-da91-4010-b714-d22851a722c21653306745037-Puma-Women-Sports-Shoes-5731653306744449-1.jpg', NOW(6), NOW(6)),
(3, 'ADIDAS Women Black Woven Design SL20 X Marimekko Running Shoes', 'Special TechnologiesLightstrike cushioningContinental Rubber outsoleProduct design detailsMain materials: Textile upper/ Rubber outsoleBrand colour: CBLACK/PRPTNT/CONAVYLace closureWarranty: 3 monthsWarranty provided by brand/manufacturer About ADIDAS Women Black Woven Design SL20 X Marimekko Running ShoesLace up these adidas x Marimekko running shoes and get an instant mood boost. Colour details embody the Finnish brand''s joyful style that celebrates female empowerment. Ultralight Lightstrike cushioning delivers a comfortable stride and explosive speed when you want it. Made with a series of recycled materials, this upper features at least 50% recycled content. This product represents just one of our solutions to help end plastic waste. Material & Care: Upper material: Textile&nbsp;. Sole material: Rubber. Wipe with a clean wet or dry cloth.', 12999.00, 97, 'https://assets.myntassets.com/assets/images/18374802/2023/2/15/f05fda1e-6360-4386-9cc5-09a88f1133321676460438746-ADIDAS-Women-Black-Woven-Design-SL20-X-Marimekko-Running-Sho-1.jpg', NOW(6), NOW(6)),
(3, 'Puma Women Black Run XX Nitro Running Shoes', 'Special Technology:CUSHIONING: NITRO: LIGHT & RESPONSIVE: Advanced foam technology providing superior responsiveness and cushioning in a lightweight packageFOOTSTRIKE GUIDANCE: RUNGUIDE, a firm density rim, promotes proper alignment and keeps the foot centered through each strideFeatures:A pair of black shoes, has regular Styling, lace-ups detailTextile UpperCushioned footbedNITRO Foam midsolePUMAGRIP high-traction rubber outsoleTextured and patterned outsoleWarranty: 3 monthsWarranty provided by Brand/Manufacturer. Material & Care: Textile. Wipe with a clean dry cloth to remove dust.', 5499.00, 38, 'https://assets.myntassets.com/assets/images/16824670/2022/11/6/fee12856-bac3-4d5b-9ca4-ae5e3b2a56f81667717854330PumaWomenBlackRunXXNitroRunningShoes1.jpg', NOW(6), NOW(6)),
(3, 'ADIDAS Men Black & White Woven Design Ultraboost 5.0 DNA Running Shoes', 'Product Design Details:Main material: Textile upper/ rubber outsoleBrand color: Core Black / Cloud White / Solar OrangeLace closure with eyelets Woven UpperSupportive, energy-returning feelFitcounter moulded heel counterBOOST midsoleClassic Adidas 3 stripe detail on sidesAdidas branding on tongueWarranty: 3 monthsWarranty provided by brand/manufacturerAbout Men Woven Design Ultraboost 5.0 DNA Running ShoesThe Ultraboost isn''t our first performance running shoe to hold appeal in the realm of fashion. It''s just one of the most beloved. That''s why we made the Ultraboost DNA Shoes, a lifestyle trainer built off the bones of its more technical namesake. The simplicity of the design shines a spotlight on the pattern of the adidas PRIMEKNIT. And because comfort''s a non-negotiable, run or no run, BOOST offers incredible energy return in every step. Material & Care: Upper: Textile. Outsole: Rubber. Wipe with a clean and dry cloth when needed.', 10199.00, 85, 'https://assets.myntassets.com/assets/images/18374200/2022/8/25/12316aaa-0e24-4ef3-a2d9-925bbf0a305e1661410728360-ADIDAS-Men-Black--White-Woven-Design-Ultraboost-50-DNA-Runni-1.jpg', NOW(6), NOW(6)),
