(3, 'ADIDAS Women White Solid Courtpoint Tennis Shoes', 'Special Technologies:Cloudfoam Comfort socklinerCloudfoam midsoleProduct Details:Main material: Leather upper/ rubber outsoleBrand colour: FTWWHT/IRIDES/ALMPNKClasssic three stripe detail on the sidesLace-up closureWarranty: 3 monthsWarranty provided by the brand owner/ manufacturerAbout Adidas Courtpoint Tennis ShoesCourt looks never get old. These adidas tennis-inspired shoes match a classic style with modern comfort, thanks to the Cloudfoam Comfort sockliner that rides on a pillow-soft Cloudfoam midsole. Stitched-on 3-Stripes and a colour pop on the heel tab seal the deal. Made in part with recycled content generated from production waste, e.g. cutting scraps, and post-consumer household waste to avoid the larger environmental impact of producing virgin content. Material & Care: Upper: Leather and textile. Outsole: Rubber. Wipe with a clean and dry cloth to remove dust.', 3249.00, 194, 'https://assets.myntassets.com/assets/images/18374978/2022/10/31/3c2b9399-8571-43e3-9c20-0a31d9de13311667205702499-ADIDAS-Women-White-Textile-Tennis-Shoes-3211667205702268-1.jpg', NOW(6), NOW(6)),
(3, 'Skechers Women Black GO WALK 4-ARRAY Shoes', 'Special Technologies:New Skechers Goga Max(r) insole for next generation cushioning and supportDesign Details:A pair of black shoes, has regular Styling, slip-on detailMesh UpperCushioned footbedTextured and patterned outsoleFabric upper engineered to naturally expand with your foot while you walkLightweight soft heathered mesh fabric upper for comfortable fitBamboo lined footbed for anti bacterial odor controlGoga Pillars on outsole evolved into a more streamlined designTapering midfoot design for improved arch supportAthletic heathered finish soft woven mesh fabric upper3D printed synthetic overlays at toe and heel for added durabilityHighly breathable lightweight and comfortable upper designContrast coloured collar trim detailFeatherweight sockliner adapts to the foot while you walkNatural expansion provides a comfortable, natural fitStabilizing heel fabric overlay panelsSide S logoQuick-Fit Portal on heel for easy pull on wearWarranty: 3 monthsWarranty provided by brand/manufacturerAbout GO WALK 4-ARRAY: Every day is a choice. Choose greatness with the Skechers GOwalk 4 - Array. Features innovative 5GEN(r) midsole design and an advanced soft fabric upper with new Skechers Goga Max(r) insole for the most advanced walking experience ever. Material & Care: Mesh. Wipe with Clean and dry cloth to remove dust.', 3899.00, 77, 'https://assets.myntassets.com/assets/images/18906226/2023/2/16/1ffd009b-aff3-4b08-b215-94273ddab9341676518199689-Skechers-Women-Black-GO-WALK-4-ARRAY-Shoes-7801676518199190-1.jpg', NOW(6), NOW(6)),
(3, 'ADIDAS Women Navy Blue & Orange Ultraboost 22 X Marimekko Running Shoes', 'Special TechnologiesBOOST midsoleStretchweb outsole with Continental RubberProduct design detailsMain materials: Textile upper/ Rubber outsoleBrand colour: LUSRED/CONAVY/CORANGLace closureWarranty: 3 monthsWarranty provided by brand/manufacturer About ADIDAS Women Navy Blue & Orange Ultraboost 22 X Marimekko Running Shoes Run wild. Marimekko is a Finnish design house known for its eye-popping prints. These adidas Ultraboost shoes wake up your running style with a bold pattern on the upper. Wear them for training or as part of your daily rotation. BOOST offers incredible energy return, and the Stretchweb outsole with Continental Rubber provides a smooth and flexible ride. This shoe''s upper is made with a high-performance yarn which contains at least 50% Parley Ocean Plastic -- reimagined plastic waste, intercepted on remote islands, beaches, coastal communities and shorelines, preventing it from polluting our ocean. The other 50% of the yarn is recycled polyester. Material & Care: Upper material: Textile&nbsp;. Sole material: Rubber. Wipe with a clean wet or dry cloth.', 14249.00, 138, 'https://assets.myntassets.com/assets/images/18374614/2022/7/15/3bd6b131-3675-4496-a842-8efbcac8eb291657875337643-ADIDAS-Women-Navy-Blue--Orange-Ultraboost-22-X-Marimekko-Run-1.jpg', NOW(6), NOW(6)),
