(7, 'KREDO Men FORTE Silver Automatic Skeleton Analogue Watch-KW039', 'Features:Nothing about the Forte is subtle, it''s bold from the get go and you''ll definitely feel it! From the timeless stainless steel strap, to the rotatable bezel, you truly can''t go wrong. It''s the first watch we''ve released to feature both a stainless steel strap and a beautiful rotatable bezel, if you''re looking for a statement piece then look no further. We provide free Pickup and Drop Services for any warranty or services related issue.Movement: Powered by a 21-jewel automatic movement in a 43 mm 316L stainless steel case. Your new KREDO watch is an exquisite piece of engineering which has been handmade and carefully tested by our KREDO engineering experts.Water Resistance: Water-resistant to up to 30 meters in depth. They are now suitable for low-velocity and shallow-water activities, including swimming.KREDO is an Amsterdam, Netherlands-based brand which has a belief that you can be the best version of yourself. You can accomplish everything you set your mind to believe in your own goals and dreams.Warranty provided by Brand Owner / Manufacturer Disclaimer: 1 year of National Warranty. Home Pickup & Drop Facilities available for servicing. Need Invoice or Warranty Card to claim warranty. Warranty on the product is covered by manufacturing defects only. Physical Damage, Wear & Tear and Dis-colouring not covered under Warranty.How to Use:The watch should be wound up at the same time every day so that the watch has enough energy to operate in the next 24 hours. The mechanical watch should be worn in time after adjustment. If you don''t wear it for a long time, it will cause the string force to be insufficient and stop it. Please re-adjust it if you wear it again. Because the mechanical watch is greatly affected by factors such as gravity, mechanical friction, etc. Material & Care: Wipe with a Clean &amp; Dry Cloth and Handle with Care. Size & Fit: Dial width:. Strap Width.', 11890.00, 22, 'https://assets.myntassets.com/assets/images/13698258/2021/2/20/370fa6db-cc8d-434e-a127-cdcb4c8cf0b91613820962780-KREDO-Men-Silver-Toned-Analogue-Watch-351613820961675-1.jpg', NOW(6), NOW(6)),
